{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with scgpt in a multimodal multiprofile setup using ViT-L image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy (0.520) and F1 (0.479) were significantly lower than the prior high-performing configuration (config_039: 0.725 accuracy), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may negatively impact performance. However, the exact contribution of scgpt versus other factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative encoders or further optimization."
}

